  <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="page-content">
      <div class="seo-answer"><strong>Direct answer:</strong> Aasha at Mind Grace Neuropsychiatric Clinic in Greater Noida is the clinic's Early Intervention Center wing, providing occupational therapy, speech and language therapy, ABA, and special education at ₹700 per 45-minute session of any service. If multiple sessions are needed within a week, come and talk to us at the reception — mental health care should be affordable by all.</div>
